    "name": "Low-Fidelity Wireframes"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "379:58",
    "name": "The sketches were translated into low-fidelity wireframes to validate navigation, information hierarchy, and core user flows. Working in low fidelity made it easier to iterate quickly before moving into high-fidelity designs."
  },
