  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "320:170",
    "name": "InfluCrush explores a new category at the intersection of the creator economy and online dating. Designed from scratch, it gives creators full control over who they connect with while helping users build meaningful relationships through a trust-first, subscription-based experience."
  },
